{"id":"n61397-1-11","stage":4,"title":"동굴 · 洞穴","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61397-1-11-1","ko":"엄마, 박쥐들은 어디에 살아요?","zh":"妈妈，蝙蝠住在哪里呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박쥐들은","meaning":"蝙蝠","explanation":"박쥐：蝙蝠；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"박쥐","audio":"/audio/7fa7b244bdd2e9007d58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57350","senseId":"1","lemma":"박쥐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살아요?","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"7fa7b244bdd2e900","term":"박쥐","zh":"蝙蝠","audio":"/audio/7fa7b244bdd2e9007d58.mp3","entryId":"57350","definition":"一种和老鼠长相相似的夜行性飞行动物，主要生活在洞穴或树林中。","pronunciation":["박ː쮜"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/64532155bcf2b87a14a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61397-1-11-2","ko":"주로 어두운 동굴 속에서 산단다.","zh":"它们主要生活在黑暗的洞穴里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어두운","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동굴","meaning":"洞穴，洞窟","explanation":"동굴：洞穴，洞窟","readings":[{"term":"동굴","audio":"/audio/a6ad9ab946adbb2ca17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61397","senseId":"1","lemma":"동굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속에서","meaning":"里，内，里边","explanation":"속：里，内，里边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"1","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산단다.","meaning":"住，生活；表示引用。","explanation":"살다：住，生活；하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"082e27671571beef","term":"주로","zh":"主要","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3","entryId":"91767","definition":"成为基本或重心地。","pronunciation":["주로"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"a6ad9ab946adbb2c","term":"동굴","zh":"洞穴，洞窟","audio":"/audio/a6ad9ab946adbb2ca17f.mp3","entryId":"61397","definition":"自然生成的又宽又深的洞。","pronunciation":["동ː굴"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"里，内，里边","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"被外皮或外壳包裹的物体的里面部分。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/66161f23b5e8efd52120.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61397","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["它们主要生活在黑暗的洞穴里。","妈妈，蝙蝠住在哪里呀？","看来春天已经来了呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，蝙蝠住在哪里呀？","看来春天已经来了呢。","它们主要生活在黑暗的洞穴里。"],"answer":2}]}
